{"type": "say", "text": "Thanks everyone for joining. As we kick off this quarterly cost review for the video-transcoding cluster, I want to make sure we follow our standard process. The current draft policy proposes a peak allowance of 6 GPU nodes, one shared pool for all customers, 30 days of standard logs, and cross-region archival to us-west-2. Before I make any final decision, I need each of you — reliability, security, support, and FinOps — to confirm your operational constraints with this proposal. Please walk through any concerns or blockers you see so we can address them before publishing."}
```

